{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":15,"title":"The supreme being","hosts":[{"id":"A","name":"Emma","voice":"en-US-EmmaMultilingualNeural"},{"id":"B","name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"}],"duration":571.632,"segments":[{"title":"Welcome","start":0.0},{"title":"The story","start":44.424},{"title":"Lesson 1 · The upside-down tree","start":397.968},{"title":"Lesson 2 · Fragrance on the wind","start":437.424},{"title":"Lesson 3 · The inner light","start":467.424},{"title":"Lesson 4 · Beyond both","start":505.656},{"title":"Wrap-up","start":543.192}],"turns":[{"s":"A","start":0.0,"end":3.0,"text":"Welcome to Shruti. I'm Emma.","L":[],"words":[[0.105,0.408,"Welcome"],[0.526,0.132,"to"],[0.671,0.579,"Shruti"],[1.658,0.329,"I'm"],[2.0,0.618,"Emma"]]},{"s":"B","start":3.288,"end":8.136,"text":"And I'm Brian. Today, Chapter Fifteen: the Supreme Being.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.118,"And"],[0.197,0.184,"I'm"],[0.395,0.513,"Brian"],[1.329,0.487,"Today"],[1.829,0.461,"Chapter"],[2.303,0.737,"Fifteen"],[3.329,0.132,"the"],[3.474,0.553,"Supreme"],[4.039,0.408,"Being"]]},{"s":"A","start":8.424,"end":23.328,"text":"Only twenty verses, and in many Indian homes it's the chapter recited before meals, because Krishna says he is the fire that digests our food. It opens with one of the strangest images in the Gita: a tree growing upside down.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.263,"Only"],[0.368,0.342,"twenty"],[0.724,0.632,"verses"],[1.605,0.158,"and"],[1.776,0.105,"in"],[1.895,0.276,"many"],[2.184,0.368,"Indian"],[2.566,0.382,"homes"],[2.961,0.171,"it's"],[3.145,0.105,"the"],[3.263,0.474,"chapter"],[3.75,0.487,"recited"],[4.25,0.355,"before"],[4.618,0.513,"meals"],[5.487,0.342,"because"],[5.842,0.447,"Krishna"],[6.303,0.316,"says"],[6.632,0.132,"he"],[6.776,0.118,"is"],[6.908,0.105,"the"],[7.026,0.368,"fire"],[7.408,0.184,"that"],[7.605,0.566,"digests"],[8.184,0.145,"our"],[8.342,0.487,"food"],[9.263,0.118,"It"],[9.395,0.395,"opens"],[9.803,0.158,"with"],[9.974,0.171,"one"],[10.158,0.079,"of"],[10.25,0.092,"the"],[10.355,0.671,"strangest"],[11.039,0.5,"images"],[11.553,0.118,"in"],[11.684,0.092,"the"],[11.789,0.447,"Gita"],[12.842,0.066,"a"],[12.921,0.303,"tree"],[13.237,0.382,"growing"],[13.632,0.434,"upside"],[14.079,0.434,"down"]]},{"s":"B","start":23.616,"end":28.944,"text":"Twenty verses. It's one of the shortest chapters, and somehow one of the fullest.","L":[],"words":[[0.079,0.342,"Twenty"],[0.434,0.671,"verses"],[1.484,0.184,"It's"],[1.682,0.171,"one"],[1.866,0.079,"of"],[1.958,0.079,"the"],[2.05,0.5,"shortest"],[2.563,0.645,"chapters"],[3.234,0.171,"and"],[3.418,0.447,"somehow"],[3.879,0.171,"one"],[4.063,0.079,"of"],[4.155,0.092,"the"],[4.261,0.671,"fullest"]]},{"s":"A","start":29.232,"end":36.216,"text":"It's a bit like a summary of everything Krishna has said so far, packed into a few pictures you can carry around.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.158,"It's"],[0.263,0.066,"a"],[0.342,0.197,"bit"],[0.553,0.197,"like"],[0.763,0.066,"a"],[0.842,0.5,"summary"],[1.355,0.118,"of"],[1.487,0.487,"everything"],[1.987,0.461,"Krishna"],[2.461,0.237,"has"],[2.711,0.224,"said"],[2.947,0.211,"so"],[3.171,0.461,"far"],[3.974,0.342,"packed"],[4.329,0.263,"into"],[4.605,0.066,"a"],[4.684,0.25,"few"],[4.947,0.553,"pictures"],[5.513,0.092,"you"],[5.618,0.158,"can"],[5.789,0.316,"carry"],[6.118,0.487,"around"]]},{"s":"B","start":36.504,"end":43.56,"text":"Four lessons, and some of the most beautiful images in the whole Gita. Let's start with the story, and the tree.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.263,"Four"],[0.368,0.658,"lessons"],[1.053,0.184,"and"],[1.25,0.197,"some"],[1.461,0.053,"of"],[1.526,0.066,"the"],[1.605,0.303,"most"],[1.921,0.5,"beautiful"],[2.434,0.539,"images"],[2.987,0.158,"in"],[3.158,0.053,"the"],[3.224,0.263,"whole"],[3.5,0.474,"Gita"],[4.382,0.184,"Let's"],[4.579,0.382,"start"],[4.974,0.145,"with"],[5.132,0.092,"the"],[5.237,0.605,"story"],[5.868,0.197,"and"],[6.079,0.079,"the"],[6.171,0.487,"tree"]]},{"s":"A","start":44.424,"end":59.4,"text":"Fifteen point one: sages speak of the eternal banyan tree that has its root above, in the Supreme Being, and its branches below, in the cosmos, and whose leaves are the Vedic hymns. One who understands this tree knows the Vedas.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.461,"Fifteen"],[0.566,0.303,"point"],[0.882,0.342,"one"],[1.789,0.421,"sages"],[2.224,0.316,"speak"],[2.553,0.105,"of"],[2.671,0.079,"the"],[2.763,0.461,"eternal"],[3.237,0.408,"banyan"],[3.658,0.263,"tree"],[3.934,0.145,"that"],[4.092,0.237,"has"],[4.342,0.184,"its"],[4.539,0.171,"root"],[4.724,0.474,"above"],[5.5,0.105,"in"],[5.618,0.105,"the"],[5.737,0.513,"Supreme"],[6.263,0.421,"Being"],[6.961,0.118,"and"],[7.092,0.171,"its"],[7.276,0.5,"branches"],[7.789,0.461,"below"],[8.5,0.105,"in"],[8.618,0.092,"the"],[8.724,0.724,"cosmos"],[9.724,0.118,"and"],[9.855,0.25,"whose"],[10.118,0.316,"leaves"],[10.447,0.079,"are"],[10.539,0.092,"the"],[10.645,0.368,"Vedic"],[11.026,0.5,"hymns"],[11.961,0.184,"One"],[12.158,0.145,"who"],[12.316,0.684,"understands"],[13.013,0.171,"this"],[13.197,0.276,"tree"],[13.487,0.289,"knows"],[13.789,0.092,"the"],[13.895,0.697,"Vedas"]]},{"s":"B","start":59.688,"end":72.072,"text":"A note from outside the book: the banyan is a famous tree in India that sends roots down from its branches, so one tree can become a whole grove. A good picture for a world that keeps spreading.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.053,"A"],[0.158,0.263,"note"],[0.434,0.184,"from"],[0.711,0.5,"outside"],[1.224,0.066,"the"],[1.303,0.303,"book"],[2.276,0.092,"the"],[2.382,0.382,"banyan"],[2.776,0.145,"is"],[2.934,0.053,"a"],[3.0,0.434,"famous"],[3.447,0.355,"tree"],[3.816,0.105,"in"],[3.934,0.408,"India"],[4.355,0.145,"that"],[4.513,0.342,"sends"],[4.868,0.289,"roots"],[5.171,0.329,"down"],[5.513,0.171,"from"],[5.697,0.132,"its"],[5.842,0.553,"branches"],[6.921,0.197,"so"],[7.132,0.197,"one"],[7.342,0.316,"tree"],[7.671,0.158,"can"],[7.842,0.263,"become"],[8.118,0.026,"a"],[8.158,0.263,"whole"],[8.434,0.461,"grove"],[9.316,0.092,"A"],[9.421,0.25,"good"],[9.684,0.447,"picture"],[10.145,0.171,"for"],[10.329,0.092,"a"],[10.434,0.474,"world"],[10.921,0.171,"that"],[11.105,0.276,"keeps"],[11.395,0.592,"spreading"]]},{"s":"A","start":72.36,"end":88.416,"text":"Fifteen point two: the branches spread all over the cosmos. The tree is nourished by the three modes; sense pleasures are its sprouts; and its roots of ego, attachment and desire stretch down into the human world, causing Karmic bondage.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.461,"Fifteen"],[0.566,0.316,"point"],[0.895,0.355,"two"],[1.684,0.105,"the"],[1.803,0.5,"branches"],[2.316,0.434,"spread"],[2.763,0.197,"all"],[2.974,0.197,"over"],[3.184,0.092,"the"],[3.289,0.803,"cosmos"],[4.526,0.092,"The"],[4.632,0.289,"tree"],[4.934,0.145,"is"],[5.092,0.434,"nourished"],[5.539,0.132,"by"],[5.684,0.118,"the"],[5.816,0.263,"three"],[6.092,0.513,"modes"],[7.039,0.329,"sense"],[7.382,0.513,"pleasures"],[7.908,0.118,"are"],[8.039,0.158,"its"],[8.211,0.632,"sprouts"],[9.211,0.132,"and"],[9.355,0.197,"its"],[9.566,0.276,"roots"],[9.855,0.132,"of"],[10.013,0.447,"ego"],[10.737,0.632,"attachment"],[11.382,0.092,"and"],[11.487,0.5,"desire"],[12.0,0.434,"stretch"],[12.447,0.289,"down"],[12.75,0.211,"into"],[12.974,0.079,"the"],[13.066,0.395,"human"],[13.474,0.434,"world"],[14.197,0.368,"causing"],[14.579,0.408,"Karmic"],[15.0,0.658,"bondage"]]},{"s":"B","start":88.704,"end":98.376,"text":"So the tree is the whole world of our experience. And it's fed by the three modes, the same goodness, passion and inertia we met in chapter fourteen.","L":[],"words":[[0.051,0.184,"So"],[0.249,0.092,"the"],[0.354,0.447,"tree"],[0.814,0.211,"is"],[1.038,0.092,"the"],[1.143,0.342,"whole"],[1.499,0.474,"world"],[1.986,0.158,"of"],[2.157,0.145,"our"],[2.314,0.842,"experience"],[3.579,0.118,"And"],[3.711,0.171,"it's"],[3.895,0.316,"fed"],[4.224,0.158,"by"],[4.395,0.118,"the"],[4.526,0.289,"three"],[4.829,0.513,"modes"],[5.368,0.118,"the"],[5.5,0.342,"same"],[5.855,0.513,"goodness"],[6.395,0.526,"passion"],[6.934,0.118,"and"],[7.066,0.539,"inertia"],[7.618,0.145,"we"],[7.776,0.303,"met"],[8.092,0.132,"in"],[8.237,0.395,"chapter"],[8.645,0.632,"fourteen"]]},{"s":"A","start":98.664,"end":109.392,"text":"And the sprouts are sense pleasures. That's such a precise image. Every little pleasure is a new green shoot, and every shoot becomes another branch to hold on to.","L":[],"words":[[0.105,0.092,"And"],[0.211,0.092,"the"],[0.316,0.461,"sprouts"],[0.789,0.092,"are"],[0.895,0.342,"sense"],[1.25,0.75,"pleasures"],[2.434,0.263,"That's"],[2.711,0.237,"such"],[2.961,0.066,"a"],[3.039,0.539,"precise"],[3.645,0.539,"image"],[4.605,0.316,"Every"],[4.934,0.263,"little"],[5.211,0.461,"pleasure"],[5.684,0.145,"is"],[5.842,0.053,"a"],[5.908,0.25,"new"],[6.171,0.316,"green"],[6.5,0.408,"shoot"],[7.408,0.145,"and"],[7.566,0.303,"every"],[7.882,0.329,"shoot"],[8.224,0.395,"becomes"],[8.632,0.382,"another"],[9.026,0.382,"branch"],[9.421,0.092,"to"],[9.526,0.289,"hold"],[9.829,0.197,"on"],[10.039,0.289,"to"]]},{"s":"B","start":109.68,"end":128.184,"text":"And the instruction, fifteen point three and four: its real form isn't perceptible here, nor its beginning or end. Having cut its firm roots, ego and desire, with the mighty axe of Self-knowledge and detachment, seek that supreme abode from which one does not come back.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.118,"And"],[0.224,0.066,"the"],[0.303,0.724,"instruction"],[1.039,0.487,"fifteen"],[1.539,0.276,"point"],[1.829,0.342,"three"],[2.184,0.118,"and"],[2.316,0.5,"four"],[3.434,0.25,"its"],[3.697,0.342,"real"],[4.053,0.395,"form"],[4.474,0.303,"isn't"],[4.789,0.618,"perceptible"],[5.421,0.461,"here"],[6.25,0.342,"nor"],[6.605,0.171,"its"],[6.789,0.5,"beginning"],[7.303,0.224,"or"],[7.539,0.382,"end"],[8.355,0.316,"Having"],[8.684,0.224,"cut"],[8.921,0.171,"its"],[9.105,0.342,"firm"],[9.461,0.447,"roots"],[9.947,0.461,"ego"],[10.421,0.092,"and"],[10.526,0.645,"desire"],[11.487,0.184,"with"],[11.684,0.079,"the"],[11.776,0.408,"mighty"],[12.197,0.329,"axe"],[12.539,0.079,"of"],[12.632,0.842,"Self-knowledge"],[13.487,0.092,"and"],[13.592,0.724,"detachment"],[14.803,0.434,"seek"],[15.25,0.145,"that"],[15.408,0.461,"supreme"],[15.882,0.461,"abode"],[16.355,0.184,"from"],[16.553,0.211,"which"],[16.776,0.263,"one"],[17.053,0.158,"does"],[17.224,0.25,"not"],[17.487,0.211,"come"],[17.711,0.395,"back"]]},{"s":"A","start":128.472,"end":140.184,"text":"Notice it isn't the tree that's the problem. It's the roots that grip us: ego, attachment, desire. And the axe isn't violence. It's Self-knowledge and detachment.","L":[],"words":[[0.105,0.408,"Notice"],[0.526,0.132,"it"],[0.671,0.303,"isn't"],[0.987,0.092,"the"],[1.092,0.303,"tree"],[1.408,0.263,"that's"],[1.684,0.118,"the"],[1.816,0.632,"problem"],[2.868,0.171,"It's"],[3.053,0.092,"the"],[3.158,0.342,"roots"],[3.513,0.184,"that"],[3.711,0.303,"grip"],[4.026,0.316,"us"],[4.737,0.421,"ego"],[5.342,0.671,"attachment"],[6.039,0.671,"desire"],[7.145,0.105,"And"],[7.263,0.118,"the"],[7.395,0.329,"axe"],[7.737,0.303,"isn't"],[8.053,0.763,"violence"],[9.237,0.171,"It's"],[9.421,0.803,"Self-knowledge"],[10.237,0.145,"and"],[10.395,0.908,"detachment"]]},{"s":"B","start":140.472,"end":152.784,"text":"There's a prayer folded into those verses, too. Thinking, I take refuge in that primal person from whom all this came forth. So the cutting comes with a turning, toward the source.","L":[],"words":[[0.079,0.171,"There's"],[0.263,0.079,"a"],[0.355,0.408,"prayer"],[0.776,0.5,"folded"],[1.289,0.289,"into"],[1.592,0.25,"those"],[1.855,0.632,"verses"],[2.684,0.395,"too"],[3.5,0.632,"Thinking"],[4.461,0.158,"I"],[4.632,0.316,"take"],[4.961,0.605,"refuge"],[5.579,0.145,"in"],[5.737,0.224,"that"],[5.974,0.382,"primal"],[6.368,0.461,"person"],[6.842,0.211,"from"],[7.066,0.263,"whom"],[7.355,0.237,"all"],[7.605,0.197,"this"],[7.816,0.289,"came"],[8.118,0.526,"forth"],[9.025,0.171,"So"],[9.209,0.105,"the"],[9.328,0.355,"cutting"],[9.696,0.329,"comes"],[10.038,0.184,"with"],[10.236,0.066,"a"],[10.314,0.539,"turning"],[10.88,0.342,"toward"],[11.236,0.066,"the"],[11.314,0.592,"source"]]},{"s":"A","start":153.072,"end":163.728,"text":"Fifteen point five: the wise reach that goal, free from pride and delusion, having conquered attachment, desires stilled, beyond pleasure and pain.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.105,0.487,"Fifteen"],[0.605,0.289,"point"],[0.908,0.5,"five"],[2.0,0.132,"the"],[2.145,0.355,"wise"],[2.513,0.263,"reach"],[2.789,0.197,"that"],[3.0,0.382,"goal"],[3.645,0.263,"free"],[3.921,0.237,"from"],[4.171,0.368,"pride"],[4.553,0.079,"and"],[4.645,0.618,"delusion"],[5.618,0.276,"having"],[5.908,0.421,"conquered"],[6.342,0.711,"attachment"],[7.474,0.553,"desires"],[8.039,0.461,"stilled"],[8.75,0.408,"beyond"],[9.171,0.474,"pleasure"],[9.658,0.105,"and"],[9.776,0.474,"pain"]]},{"s":"B","start":164.016,"end":175.008,"text":"And a description of that abode, fifteen point six: the sun does not illumine it, nor the moon, nor fire. Having reached there, people do not come back.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.158,"And"],[0.263,0.066,"a"],[0.342,0.618,"description"],[0.974,0.092,"of"],[1.079,0.184,"that"],[1.276,0.553,"abode"],[2.158,0.526,"fifteen"],[2.697,0.289,"point"],[3.0,0.553,"six"],[4.053,0.118,"the"],[4.184,0.355,"sun"],[4.553,0.171,"does"],[4.737,0.237,"not"],[4.987,0.382,"illumine"],[5.382,0.276,"it"],[5.961,0.289,"nor"],[6.263,0.079,"the"],[6.355,0.474,"moon"],[6.842,0.25,"nor"],[7.105,0.566,"fire"],[8.092,0.355,"Having"],[8.461,0.368,"reached"],[8.842,0.316,"there"],[9.184,0.329,"people"],[9.526,0.132,"do"],[9.671,0.25,"not"],[9.934,0.184,"come"],[10.132,0.474,"back"]]},{"s":"B","start":175.296,"end":187.2,"text":"That line always moves me. A light that doesn't need the sun. It's a way of saying the goal isn't another place inside this world, it's what makes this world shine in the first place.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.197,"That"],[0.276,0.368,"line"],[0.658,0.434,"always"],[1.105,0.382,"moves"],[1.5,0.316,"me"],[2.211,0.079,"A"],[2.303,0.382,"light"],[2.697,0.184,"that"],[2.895,0.329,"doesn't"],[3.237,0.25,"need"],[3.5,0.092,"the"],[3.605,0.5,"sun"],[4.484,0.158,"It's"],[4.655,0.079,"a"],[4.747,0.25,"way"],[5.011,0.092,"of"],[5.116,0.368,"saying"],[5.497,0.105,"the"],[5.616,0.408,"goal"],[6.05,0.289,"isn't"],[6.353,0.342,"another"],[6.708,0.382,"place"],[7.103,0.447,"inside"],[7.563,0.171,"this"],[7.747,0.474,"world"],[8.761,0.211,"it's"],[8.984,0.171,"what"],[9.168,0.303,"makes"],[9.484,0.184,"this"],[9.682,0.316,"world"],[10.011,0.461,"shine"],[10.484,0.132,"in"],[10.629,0.079,"the"],[10.721,0.316,"first"],[11.05,0.461,"place"]]},{"s":"A","start":187.488,"end":199.464,"text":"Then the soul. Fifteen point seven: the eternal individual soul in the body is, indeed, My integral part. It draws to itself the six senses, including the mind.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.105,0.171,"Then"],[0.289,0.092,"the"],[0.395,0.526,"soul"],[1.342,0.513,"Fifteen"],[1.868,0.329,"point"],[2.211,0.461,"seven"],[3.316,0.092,"the"],[3.421,0.487,"eternal"],[3.921,0.658,"individual"],[4.592,0.342,"soul"],[4.947,0.092,"in"],[5.053,0.092,"the"],[5.158,0.382,"body"],[5.553,0.197,"is"],[5.789,0.5,"indeed"],[6.316,0.145,"My"],[6.474,0.553,"integral"],[7.039,0.5,"part"],[7.974,0.105,"It"],[8.092,0.368,"draws"],[8.474,0.158,"to"],[8.645,0.461,"itself"],[9.118,0.105,"the"],[9.237,0.316,"six"],[9.566,0.618,"senses"],[10.395,0.526,"including"],[10.934,0.079,"the"],[11.026,0.553,"mind"]]},{"s":"B","start":199.752,"end":212.736,"text":"And a lovely image, fifteen point eight: just as the air takes aroma away from a flower, the soul takes the senses from the body it leaves at death to the new body it acquires, by the power of Karma.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.092,0.132,"And"],[0.237,0.066,"a"],[0.316,0.434,"lovely"],[0.763,0.461,"image"],[1.237,0.513,"fifteen"],[1.763,0.303,"point"],[2.079,0.342,"eight"],[3.039,0.342,"just"],[3.395,0.105,"as"],[3.513,0.079,"the"],[3.605,0.316,"air"],[3.934,0.263,"takes"],[4.211,0.434,"aroma"],[4.658,0.3